sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sym as Symptom
    participant Eng as Engineer
    participant Sys as System
    Sym->>Eng: the host is slow
    Eng->>Sys: is it CPU, memory, disk, or network?
    Sys-->>Eng: load average and run queue
    alt run queue long, CPU busy
        Eng->>Sys: which process, user or system time?
    else run queue long, CPU idle
        Eng->>Sys: uninterruptible sleep — it is waiting on I/O
    end
    Eng->>Sys: confirm with the instrument, not the guess
    Sys-->>Eng: the saturated resource
    Eng->>Eng: is this the cause, or another symptom of it?
    Note over Eng,Sys: work down the stack — every layer can fake the symptoms of the one below
